:"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-21T08:45:34-08:00","id":1425363,"title":"","content":"This would be a really useful community resource. Exalted used to have one of these (before CPE destroyed it) and tons of campaigns used it.<br /> Just don't put it on a server controlled by the whim of someone else, who might choose to delete the data without warning.<br /> <br /> I will happily contribute what I've written. I also have a long list of urls to homebrew material I liked. I would caution that unless somebody contributes their own writing, it's better to link to their website (or an archive of it) instead of reposting their material.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 11-21-2020, 11:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-22T21:06:17-08:00","id":1425632,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1422146-potentially-working-on-a-homebrew-database?p=1425363#post1425363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This would be a really useful community resource. Exalted used to have one of these (before CPE destroyed it) and tons of campaigns used it.<br /> Just don't put it on a server controlled by the whim of someone else, who might choose to delete the data without warning.<br /> <br /> I will happily contribute what I've written. I also have a long list of urls to homebrew material I liked. I would caution that unless somebody contributes their own writing, it's better to link to their website (or an archive of it) instead of reposting their material.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That destroyed my creative inertia when I used it as a backup for my projects and my maincomputer went kaput and the site went down... very lame. Hard to not be handshy after a major fanresource was vanished.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}